  "description": "DEDYAO crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H36 N9 O20 Tb3 2-,3(Na1 1+),5(C1 H4 O1),4.5(H2 O1),C1 H3 O1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.862-3.862 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.14-110.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H68N9Na3O31Tb3.",
